# Changelog

All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

This project follows the principles of [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).

## [0.2.0] - 2026-10-30

### Added

- Supabase client integration with environment validation.
- Books service layer with table fallback and runtime diagnostics.
- Book model mapping for heterogeneous schemas (`title`, `bookName`, image fields).
- Book card UI with cover image support and graceful placeholder.
- Internationalized routes with locale paths (`/es-es`, `/en-en`).
- Language selector in the header using a scalable dropdown.
- Localized UI dictionary for Spanish and English.

### Changed

- Main index now acts as a language entry page.
- Legacy `/es` and `/en` routes redirect to `/es-es` and `/en-en`.
- Styling architecture refactored from a monolithic file into modular SCSS partials:
  - `src/styles/_tokens.scss`
  - `src/styles/_base.scss`
  - `src/styles/_header.scss`
  - `src/styles/_layout.scss`
  - `src/styles/_books.scss`
  - `src/styles/_footer.scss`
  - `src/styles/_responsive.scss`

### Fixed

- Supabase URL normalization for `postgresql://...` input in `.env`.
- Table-not-found handling with clear guidance when schema/table mismatch happens.
- Runtime module resolution issues for i18n imports by moving to stable relative imports.

## [0.1.0] - Initial setup

### Added

- Initialize the project repository.
- Create the initial project documentation.
- Add contribution guidelines.
- Prepare the documentation structure.
- Footer.
- Header.
- ESLint.
